{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dreadmark Outlaws \u2013 a dark Western shooter</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The official novel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>official novel</strong> expands the universe of Dreadmark Outlaws with backstory, characters, places, and events the game only hints at \u2014 perfect if you want to dive deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusty mining towns. Abandoned saloons. And something that refuses to rest. In <strong>Dreadmark Outlaws</strong>, you fight for every breath as an outlaw \u2014 against hordes of man-eaters, terrifying creatures, and other outlaws who are just as desperate as you are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or co-op \u2013 your choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>alone (with bots)</strong> or team up with friends in <strong>online co-op</strong>. Every match is a fight to endure: coordinate, share ammo, watch each other\u2019s backs \u2014 or split up and live with the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes: PvP, PvE &amp; Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your match the way you want:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced PvP fights</strong> against other gunslingers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op PvE modes</strong> against ever-growing hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense action</strong> when the night outlasts your ammo supply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable with bots</strong>, if you want to go solo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every bullet counts.</strong> In these times, money is worthless \u2014 <strong>ammo</strong> is the only real currency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the sun goes down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytime is dangerous. Night is ruthless. You hear gunshots in the distance, see tracks in the dust \u2014 and you quickly realize: wealth means nothing here, only survival. A steady hand on the revolver, teamwork, and enough ammo to make it to sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/4d91597720a04287f93324b94478da0c.avif?t=1773330431\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664650?t=1773330431","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/295613a8c028ed9a59e08ec3cdc13d6f03f6b0e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773330431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/68b11e0a10cbd38b2a7cb42c70c65e45efcdc4e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773330431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/68b11e0a10cbd38b2a7cb42c70c65e45efcdc4e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773330431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore, Intense Violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3881590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dreadmark Outlaws \u2013 a dark Western shooter</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The official novel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>official novel</strong> expands the universe of Dreadmark Outlaws with backstory, characters, places, and events the game only hints at \u2014 perfect if you want to dive deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusty mining towns. Abandoned saloons. And something that refuses to rest. In <strong>Dreadmark Outlaws</strong>, you fight for every breath as an outlaw \u2014 against hordes of man-eaters, terrifying creatures, and other outlaws who are just a